                "text": "In my home state of CT, people are going hungry. Families continue to face an economic crisis that has left too many struggling to obtain the food and nutrition they need.\n\nNow is the time to invest in these programs \u2014 and not let the @GOP strip them away.\nhttps://t.co/8jr2UV2bo7",
