                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "No family in the U.S. \u2014 no child \u2014 should be hungry. We have the tools to end hunger and close the nutrition gap \u2014 let\u2019s invest in them and get it done. \n\nI am proud to introduce the WIC Act along with my colleagues @RepJenniffer @RepLindaSanchez @RepKimSchrier & @RepBrianFitz. https://t.co/UPGF2cmbyC",
