                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Hunger plagues millions here in the U.S. and abroad. Now more than ever, we need new and innovative solutions to combat global hunger.\n\nI look forward to working with @chefjoseandres on new ways to strengthen our commitments to enhancing nutrition and fighting hunger worldwide.",
